TITLE 1D transport with cation exchange; query NaX at step 4

SOLUTION 0  Infilling solution
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0

SOLUTION 1-10 Initial solution in cells
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
USER_PUNCH
    -headings step cell NaX_m
10 PUNCH TRANSPORT_STEP, CELL_NO, MOL("NaX")

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -time_step 1
    -lengths 1
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -diffusion_coefficient 0
    -dispersivities 0
    -punch_cells 1-10
    -punch_frequency 1
END
